sequenceDiagram
  %% Target design: ADR 0244 task + analytics-plausible-via-swamp + gateway-root-of-trust-keys + single-swamp-node; DECISIONS 2 (DNS publication held).
  %% status: draft
  autonumber
  %% lane CLI icon=terminal pill=caller tone=gray
  %% lane GW icon=gateway pill=intent tone=blue
  %% lane SW icon=workflow pill=executes tone=green
  %% lane N icon=server pill=target tone=amber
  %% lane P icon=server pill=target tone=purple
  participant CLI as CLI / MCP<br/>orbit · MCP tools
  participant GW as Gateway<br/>Laravel API
  participant SW as Swamp<br/>serve on Node 209
  participant N as Route Node<br/>Caddy over ssh
  participant P as Plausible<br/>HTTPS from 209
  CLI->>GW: instance:analytics:enable<br/>{instance: 42}
  Note over GW: Validate, plan tracking<br/>certs, Caddy, DNS deltas
  GW->>SW: Store Plausible creds<br/>analytics-plausible-<uuid>
  GW->>SW: Start run, full intent<br/>operation-analytics-enable-direct
  GW-->>CLI: 202 Accepted<br/>task #5126
  SW->>P: Reconcile site and goals<br/>command/shell · site.py
  SW->>N: Request a CSR<br/>route-certificate-publish
  SW->>GW: Ask to sign the CSR<br/>certificate-sign primitive
  GW-->>SW: Signed leaf<br/>Orbit CA stays in Gateway
  SW->>N: Publish Caddy, probe<br/>operation-route-caddy-delta
  Note over SW: DNS publication held<br/>native-dns-takeover-held
  alt all jobs succeed
    SW-->>GW: Run succeeded<br/>terminal event + result_json
    Note over GW: Tracking Routes active<br/>store site binding
  else a job fails
    SW--xGW: Run failed<br/>error_code
    Note over GW: Routes unchanged<br/>task failed
  end
  loop every 2 s until terminal
    CLI->>GW: operation:show #5126
    GW-->>CLI: status + result
  end
